         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "I did not attempt to throw any kind of error or give any recognition that the server had received the Content-Location header. That could be added in, but since the feature was not widely documented I was not sure if we wanted to add extra code for it.",
